# =====================================================
# BlueSpice HDP Edition — .gitignore
# =====================================================

# Secrets — NEVER commit these.
# `.env` alone was too narrow: a working copy on the build box had a
# `.env.bak-preexisting` next to it, holding a live Infisical client secret,
# the LLM API key and the DB root / admin passwords, and `git status` listed
# it as untracked — one `git add -A` from being pushed. Ignore every .env
# sibling and re-allow the committed template explicitly.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.local
!.env.example

# Docker volumes / data (bind-mounted, not tracked)
mediawiki_data/
mariadb_data/
opensearch_data/
haystack_models/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# Node
node_modules/

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Session-local scratch (subagent handoff notes, temporary debug scripts,
# superseded early drafts — not part of the published project)
AGENT_BRIEFING.md
CHANGES.md
CHATBOT_FIX_PLAN.md
DEBRIEFING.md
HAYSTACK_FIX_PLAN.md
INGESTION_PIPELINE_PLAN.md
DOCKER_SETUP.md
.claude/

# Agent briefings and audit output — working notes about the repository, not
# part of it. Wildcarded rather than listed one by one: this started as three
# individual `.claude-*.md` lines and a fourth briefing appeared untracked next
# to them, holding the build host's public IP. A pattern covers the next one
# the day it is created rather than the day someone notices it in `git status`.
.claude-*
hdp-publication-readiness-report.md

# Logs
*.log

# MediaWiki generated config (contains live DB password + secret keys,
# generated by setup.sh's install.php run — NEVER commit this)
app/LocalSettings.php
app/vendor/

# MediaWiki runtime cache/state (regenerated automatically; can contain
# real user/session data via SQLite job queue and l10n caches — NEVER commit)
app/cache/

# Tool-generated state (not authored content)
docs/.codewiki-state.json
.gstack/
.pytest_cache/

# T4's CI-only HuggingFace model cache (docker/ci/compose.cache.yml bind-mounts
# this into the haystack container so actions/cache can save ~1.7 GB of model
# weights between nightly runs). Never authored content.
.hf-cache/
